{"id":"6db9bcdfcf19ccd3","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-cocycle.md","title":"Cocycle","display":"df-cocycle — Cocycle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cocycle","aliases":["58-df-cocycle","Cocycle"],"display":"df-cocycle — Cocycle","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cocycle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cocycle</span><span>Cocycle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cocycle — Cocycle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H,X,a,c,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_H\\in V\">\\(G,H,X,a,c,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_H\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cocycle}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cocycle}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cocycle} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cocycle}_S(c,G,H,a,X,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_H)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\\land a\\in X^{G\\times X}\\land c\\in H^{G\\times X}\\land\\exists e_G\\in G\\;\\left(\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_G g=g\\land g\\cdot_G e_G=g)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(a(e_G,x)=x)\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(a(g\\cdot_G h,x)=a(g,a(h,x)))\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(c(g\\cdot_G h,x)=c(g,a(h,x))\\cdot_H c(h,x))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cocycle} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cocycle}_S(c,G,H,a,X,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_H)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\\land a\\in X^{G\\times X}\\land c\\in H^{G\\times X}\\land\\exists e_G\\in G\\;\\left(\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_G g=g\\land g\\cdot_G e_G=g)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(a(e_G,x)=x)\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(a(g\\cdot_G h,x)=a(g,a(h,x)))\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(c(g\\cdot_G h,x)=c(g,a(h,x))\\cdot_H c(h,x))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cocycle: 1-cocycle in group cohomology</li>\n<li>Coboundary: cohomologically trivial</li>\n<li>Equivalence: cohomologous cocycles</li>\n<li>1-cocycle: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(g, x) \\mapsto \\langle g^{-1} \\cdot x, \\xi \\rangle\">\\((g, x) \\mapsto \\langle g^{-1} \\cdot x, \\xi \\rangle\\)</span> for representation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bredon, Introduction to Compact Transformation Groups</li>\n<li>Armitage and Hawke, Hörmander's theorem on the cocycle</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,H,X,a,c,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cocycle}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cocycle} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cocycle}_S(c,G,H,a,X,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_H)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\\land a\\in X^{G\\times X}\\land c\\in H^{G\\times X}\\land\\exists e_G\\in G\\;\\left(\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_G g=g\\land g\\cdot_G e_G=g)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(a(e_G,x)=x)\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(a(g\\cdot_G h,x)=a(g,a(h,x)))\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(c(g\\cdot_G h,x)=c(g,a(h,x))\\cdot_H c(h,x))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"(g, x) \\mapsto \\langle g^{-1} \\cdot x, \\xi \\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":1245,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-301","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-cocycle.md|58-df-cocycle]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["ed71f39f59370734"]}